{:title
 "World in Smile, a Game World Agents See and Act In, Read Tick by Tick",
 :description
 "What a world is in THE MAP of Smile, a simulated game world whose tick log is the raw stream, vision scored against the world at the same tick, an in-game Gana interface showing the exact next step, and Sangha against Sangha, and how my words reached it in the osrs work of September and October 2026, with every source.",
 :keywords
 "game world agents, OSRS AI, RuneLite plugin, tick log, vision models in games, multi-agent game play, Smile prompt language, history of Smile",
 :lede
 "In THE MAP, a world is a simulated game world that agents see and act in. The server's tick log is the raw stream, and the world at any tick is a working read over that log.",
 :paras
 ["THE MAP joins every exchange in the world to the same stream, each Gana's words with the model's parameters and timing. A frame is named by its hash and stamped with the tick it shows, and what a vision model said of it is scored claim by claim against the world at the same tick, so a difference between what was drawn and what was true is a finding. The in-game Gana interface is the working read for one reader at one moment, the exact next step and everything the person lacks for that decision. Sangha play against Sangha in formations the way pieces are placed in chess, and the entities of a world never team together against the humans in it."
 "In September 2026 I asked for notes in osrs stored by location. On 11 September 2026, “it would be cool if you stored all the notes in terms of locations. so everytihng relevant to ardy was in ardy”,[[m:2026-09-11]] and “so then you have like a text map of the game that loads as i load the real map”.[[m:2026-09-11#2]] On 13 September, “it needs to be semantically mapped to regions, quests, etc so you can get to it from any need/situation”.[[m:2026-09-13]]"
 "Through late September the world moved inside the client and its interface narrowed to the next step. On 25 September, “all windows must be integrated in the client adn appropriate to the present moment game logs for hte account thats logged in”.[[m:2026-09-25#4]] On 24 September I set the line the aid never crosses, “we never automate for VIJAYAGANESH or Dr Prompt, we ONLY aid, provide information, overlays, suggestions, hints ingame”.[[m:2026-09-24]] On 26 September, “you can recreate the entire world just enough to simlate this accurately, veriy against the real game”,[[m:2026-09-26]] and “I need absolutely everything that is not beneficial to click to be hidden at the time that its not benefiical”.[[m:2026-09-26#4]] On 30 September, “the ingame per Gana interface for each osrs client that is getting updated by the JVM/client/repl is always only showing what the EXACT NEXT STEP IS.”[[m:2026-09-30]]"
 "In October I asked for a realm of its own. On 1 October, “make it vijaya ganapati world, you are called ganapati always”,[[m:2026-10-01]] and a private server, still to be built, where “the NPC dialogue is all generated by LLMs”.[[m:2026-10-01#2]] On 3 October, “we need an alt (one of the existing accounts) to walk under other accounts (eg in LMS, multi fights, simulated fights vs each other) and mith seed so they cant seed.”[[m:2026-10-03]] On 6 October, “we will also create experimental worlds with differnet rules”.[[m:2026-10-06]] On 17 October, “PID needs to alwys be labelled on both players symbolically”.[[m:2026-10-17]]"
 "So the world moved from notes stored by location in September 2026 to a realm THE MAP reads tick by tick, its frames to be scored against its truth and its interface showing one next step, part built today, across {{moments}} moments and {{quotes}} quotes from {{first}} to {{last}}. The agents who play in it together are followed in [[t:the-smile-sangha]], and the tasks they carry in [[t:run]]."],
